Setup — fresh authorities so every run starts from the same place
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Each run generates brand new authorities in memory and funds them from the payer. The
  counter PDA is [b"counter", owner], so a fresh owner means a counter that does not exist
  yet — repeated runs therefore behave identically, with no cleanup step.
